<title>UK: MSCI developing Egypt, Morocco indexes.</title>
<headline>MSCI developing Egypt, Morocco indexes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Capital International said in a statement that its Capital Perspectives subsidiary is developing share indexes for Egypt and Morocco.</p>
<p>Details on publication date and composition will be released in &quot;coming months&quot;, MSCI said.</p>
<p>The MSCI indices are used by fund managers to allocate assets and track performance. -- David Chance London newsroom 44 171 542 5887</p>
</text>
